specs/hal-engine-architecture/spec.md:139:Loads prompt templates by name with variable substitution ([validated by: returns prompt template when found](../../src/infrastructure/stores/inMemoryPromptStore.test.ts#L11), [resolve](../../src/infrastructure/stores/inMemoryPromptStore.test.ts#L28)). Use this for database-driven prompts instead of static `PromptBuilder` configuration.
